<title>GERMANY: German call money market closed on Tuesday Dec 31.</title>
<headline>German call money market closed on Tuesday Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>German financial markets are closed for the day on Tuesday December 31. The markets will remain closed on Wednesday January 1 and will re-open on Thursday January 2.</p>
<p>On Monday, overnight call money rates climbed to the 4.50 percent Lombard lending rate as banks fought to meet month-end reserve targets.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
